      {
        "id": 63564,
        "name": "brytehfryguy",
        "username": "brytehfryguy",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/f0a364/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-05-25T16:20:02.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Sadly, the skip your turn thing doesn't even get to happen when you get bad hands.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>\"Guys my hands sucks\"</p><p>\"We know, but we need you to punch this thing with your base power even if you aren't playing any useful cards.\"</p><p>etc</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>It's pretty miserable being that player and I don't like people coming over, playing games and being miserable so we added our 1 free mull rule.</p>",
        "post_number": 7,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:40:29.254Z",
